Unicode lowercase data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Rust core includes lowercase mappings and case/whitespace properties generated from the official Unicode Character Database versions 13.0.0, 14.0.0, 15.0.0, 15.1.0, 16.0.0 and 17.0.0.
Copyright (c) 1991-2026 Unicode, Inc.
The data is licensed under Unicode-3.0.
The client distribution's THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES-RUST.txt reproduces its terms, generated by scripts/rust_core/rust_notices.py.
The first-party generator scripts/rust_core/generate_text_unicode.py records official input URLs, pinned input hashes, generator/helper hashes and derived byte hashes in rust/crates/sdm-engine/data/CASING-PROVENANCE.json.
The lowercase algorithm is first-party Rust; no third-party implementation code is vendored.
